PARSFILE
#FullDataName Events`CCRb B. Monitor Speed ACC`Euro NCAP ACC Testing
#CheckBox1 1    
*CLEAR
#CheckBox6 0    
#CheckBox7 0    
#CheckBox9 0    
#CheckBox10 0    

#RingCtrl0 <
#RingCtrl1 ZERO ~=
#RingCtrl10 2
#RingCtrl11 4
RESET_EVENTS
*NAME1 Vxz_Fwd
*NAME2 Vxz_Fwd
*VALUE1 MIN_THRESH
*VALUE2 Contact
*VALUE3 Contact
#BlueLink10 ` , Miscellaneous` , Miscellaneous` , Miscellaneous`

MAKE_EVENT Vxz_Fwd < MIN_THRESH ; Events\Events_35ae284f-cf82-41b6-92c3-a5c9cbc45b80.par
#BlueLink0 Events`CCRb C1. Monitor Stop Speed` Euro NCAP ACC Testing` , Events`Events_35ae284f-cf82-41b6-92c3-a5c9cbc45b80

